# Documentation Requirements

## Code Documentation

### PHP Requirements
- Follow PHPDoc standards
- Include inline type hints
- Document hooks/filters using WordPress standards

### JavaScript Requirements
- Follow JSDoc conventions
- Document component prop types
- Include hook documentation for custom stores

## Feature Documentation
- Create `README.md` in `/docs/` for new features
- Include:
  - Feature overview and purpose
  - CLI command references with code links
  - API endpoints and webhook documentation
  - Setup and configuration instructions
  - Troubleshooting common issues

## User Documentation
- Follow WordPress style guide
- Required elements:
  - Clear setup/configuration instructions
  - Troubleshooting common issues
  - API reference (if applicable)
  - Screenshots or diagrams when helpful

## Important Notes
- Update documentation when making significant changes
- Include version compatibility information
- Document any required environment variables or configuration 